WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:02.900
Ayanagi Police Station
Toyama Prefecture

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:04.610
This.

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:08.320
Information on the chemicals
detected in that boy's bloodstream.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:10.290
It's a new unregistered medication.

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:15.220
They can't discern part of the chemical's
composition, or how it was made.

00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:21.420
Also...

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:27.070
There was a person who came to look
at the unidentified body from NNIL.

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:32.030
We found out that person was using
a false identity to conceal his visit.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.270
He came to look at that body.

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:38.180
They said he was a young male.

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:40.670
I see.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:42.980
Ryo.

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:46.580
About Jun-kun's surgery...

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:49.220
I told Shin-kun.

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:53.490
He didn't say anything?

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:55.290
No.

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:00.490
He was more reassured than surprised.

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:04.970
He figured that's maybe why
he felt like Yuki is inside Jun.

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:12.180
It wasn't something I should've brought up.

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:14.680
I'm sorry.

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:21.690
Hey... Don't you think you treat
Shin-kun too much like a kid?

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:24.730
He sure is thinking a lot...

00:01:24.730 --> 00:01:27.130
and he's aware of a lot of stuff.

00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:38.530
She might be right...

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:19.450
kanjouni aragau nayo
Don't fight back your emotions

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:21.850
sono ashiwo tomenna
Don't ever stop

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:26.390
taoreru nowa mada hayaize
It's too soon to fall down

00:02:26.390 --> 00:02:27.920
Breakin' through
Breakin' through

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:29.720
uchinukeyo
Pierce through

00:02:29.720 --> 00:02:32.060
yamiwo hurihodoki
Free yourself from darkness

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:36.660
tadoritsuku bashowa hitotsusa
There is only one destination

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:40.330
hurueru sora
Quaking sky

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:45.760
kazewa naniwo tsugeru
What is the wind telling me?

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:51.810
tadashii datoka soujanai toka
Right or wrong

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:54.880
kudaranai ronsouwa
Nonsensical arguments

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:57.490
kieya shinai kedo
Never go away

00:02:57.490 --> 00:03:02.060
shinjita kotowo shinjinuku koto
Believe what you believe in

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:05.090
sono sakini bokurawa
At the end of it all

00:03:05.090 --> 00:03:07.600
hikari mitsukeru darou
We will find the light

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:12.830
saa tokihanate ima
Now is the time to release it

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:15.770
kanjouni aragau nayo
Don't fight back your emotions

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:18.010
sono ashiwo tomenna
Don't ever stop

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:22.580
taoreru nowa mada hayaize
It's too soon to fall down

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:24.080
Breakin' through
Breakin' through

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:26.010
uchinukeyo
Pierce through

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:28.250
yamiwo hurihodoki
Free yourself from darkness

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:32.550
tadoritsuku bashowa hitotsusa
There is only one destination

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:55.940
I don't think there's anything
to worry about anymore.

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:58.710
You've done well for ten years.

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:00.680
I didn't...

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:05.550
Thank you very much.

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:09.460
You were lucky to have met such a good doctor.

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:13.700
Not just ten years ago, but even now, there
have been so few documented successes...

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:17.690
Is the doctor not here anymore?

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:20.870
No...

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:23.770
He didn't actually belong to this hospital.

00:04:23.770 --> 00:04:26.410
He was here looking for his missing child,

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:30.470
and he happened to be visiting Ayanagi City.

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:32.950
Beyond his scope as a brain surgeon...

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:37.650
He had many significant achievements
in the field of psychology.

00:04:38.950 --> 00:04:45.050
Normally, we would've given up
on someone in Jun-kun's state.

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:46.920
However...

00:04:50.530 --> 00:04:53.440
Revealing patient information is strictly
forbidden -Komatsubara Keisuke

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:54.070
It was an operation depending on a miracle.

00:04:54.070 --> 00:04:56.200
If the late doctor hadn't left a proviso,

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:59.260
I'd jump at the chance to
present the case at a conference.

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:03.910
Oops... Excuse me.

00:05:04.180 --> 00:05:06.200
Did he pass away?

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:07.450
Yes.

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:07.920
Revealing patient information is strictly
forbidden -Komatsubara Keisuke

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:10.590
Revealing patient information is strictly

00:05:10.590 --> 00:05:11.240
I heard he got in an accident in Tokyo.

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:21.690
Hey, why didn't you tell him I've
been saying weird things lately?

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:24.930
What? Well...

00:05:24.930 --> 00:05:27.930
You're weird to begin with.

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:39.110
How was Tasaka-senpai?

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:41.320
She hasn't improved much.

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:47.420
But when Megumi-san said "I'll be back,"
she looked like she smiled a little bit.

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:48.490
Really?

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:51.360
I thought she smiled a little, too.

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:52.490
Are you sure?

00:05:57.130 --> 00:05:58.220
Aniki...

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:03.670
Hello.

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:05.370
N-nice to meet you.

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:06.600
H-hi.

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:17.950
You shouldn't come to the
hospital in such a big group.

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:20.720
What are you here for?

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:23.120
Visiting an acquaintance.

00:06:33.430 --> 00:06:37.770
If they weren't there, Tasaka Yumi would've died.

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:43.480
...Something is taking advantage of
her broken heart and broken Persona.

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:53.190
What is that something?

00:06:53.190 --> 00:06:54.290
I don't know.

00:06:54.290 --> 00:07:00.060
Anyway, what I can say for sure is
that Inui has finally found them.

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:05.970
There's a strange one mixed in, too,
but they're all significant awakenings.

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:10.430
It wouldn't be wrong to say they are the
Special A Latents we almost gave up on.

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:25.140
By the way, there was a kid
named Kanzato in the report...

00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:28.250
That's my brother.

00:07:35.730 --> 00:07:39.860
So it's true that you were
the one who saved senpai.

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:44.260
I happened to be there.

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:48.840
Did you know she was gonna
be involved in an accident?

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:51.950
How could I?

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:55.920
I heard she won't tell anyone about that accident.

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:57.510
What happened?

00:07:58.420 --> 00:08:00.610
I can't tell you that, out of duty.

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:13.970
You asked the doctor in Tokyo to
write a reference for Jun, right?

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:17.470
I had completely forgotten about it. Thanks.

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:19.800
Sure.

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:32.610
Thank you!

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:52.670
Doesn't look like he's just getting groceries.

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:54.800
I wonder if he's waiting for someone?

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:00.720
They're clean?

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:01.750
Yeah.

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:08.350
I did all I could, but looks like DSI is purely
an organization for psychological research.

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:10.060
At least for now.

00:09:11.290 --> 00:09:17.070
Their early records contain some proof
of their involvement in the project.

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:21.200
However, ever since that
man died in the accident...

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:24.610
Persona research has been virtually abandoned.

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:29.580
However, what the Marebito's control
are definitely Complex Personas.

00:09:29.580 --> 00:09:30.650
Right.

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:34.410
There must be someone following
the footsteps of Komatsubara.

00:09:41.420 --> 00:09:45.760
I gave you a year's supply half a
year ago, if I remember correctly.

00:09:45.760 --> 00:09:48.460
...They're not working as well as they used to.

00:09:48.460 --> 00:09:51.630
It only means your limit is near.

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:58.170
It's almost a miracle that you're able
to use your Persona at your age.

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:04.110
You should know that long-term use
of the pills can be life-threatening.

00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:11.590
Are these really from the batch you
made during that project back then?

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:12.750
By that, you mean?

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:15.660
Are you guys still providing...

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:21.290
If you'd like to keep receiving our support,
I'd recommend not asking any more.

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:26.370
Follow him!

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:27.200
Yes, sir!

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:37.510
Ito-san and Narasaki-kun! What a coincidence!

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:45.220
I'm sorry, I didn't know you
guys were tailing someone.

00:10:45.220 --> 00:10:46.490
Was it a vicious criminal?

00:10:46.490 --> 00:10:47.860
No, um...

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:49.320
Don't worry about it.

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:52.880
We thought we had a support witness,
but it might be pretty useless.

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:54.990
Well, good...

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:59.360
What were you doing here... Nikaido-san?

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:01.700
Groceries.

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:02.940
Oh.

00:11:02.940 --> 00:11:05.070
Anyway... I think this is a good time.

00:11:05.070 --> 00:11:07.970
Can I explain myself to correct a misunderstanding?

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:14.080
There's no doubt that Chief Kanzato
Ryo and I are old acquaintances...

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:18.520
But my transfer has nothing to do
with our personal relationship.

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:21.360
Plus, it's not possible anyway.

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:23.990
Well, nobody said it was...

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:27.480
I just happened to have taken
care of the Reverse cases...

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:30.430
but I wasn't given any details.

00:11:31.100 --> 00:11:36.540
I'm in the same situation as you, Ito-san...
unable to alert the public about this case.

00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:42.130
...That's why I have the exact same question.

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:48.180
I don't know what he is thinking.

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:51.680
He might be hiding something really important.

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:56.810
I have a favor to ask, Ito-san.

00:12:32.130 --> 00:12:33.680
In the upper cover.

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:39.560
Don't use too much salt.

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:46.130
I know!

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:52.640
I don't get this...

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:57.740
Oh, it's Eiko-neechan.

00:12:58.090 --> 00:13:00.390
Jun, take care of the rest!

00:13:00.390 --> 00:13:01.720
Niichan, not fair!

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:05.760
Good evening.

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:08.030
You look good in that.

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:09.390
What!? Oh...

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:13.430
Doesn't look like Ryo's back yet.

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:14.470
No...

00:13:14.470 --> 00:13:17.130
But he should be back soon
if today's his early night...

00:13:17.510 --> 00:13:19.170
Why don't you wait inside?

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:22.010
Have some dinner if you haven't eaten.

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:23.870
Okay.

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:36.010
Hello?

00:13:37.060 --> 00:13:38.290
Kanzato?

00:13:39.030 --> 00:13:44.690
I thought we could identify Marebito's
leader from your research...

00:13:45.830 --> 00:13:51.030
But if they're an underground
organization, in order to get the truth...

00:13:52.670 --> 00:13:56.070
Right... We've no choice but to look
into that pharmaceutical company.

00:13:57.040 --> 00:13:59.880
As long as they haven't discovered
a more effective means,

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:02.850
that medicine should still be necessary.

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:04.240
Right...

00:14:09.790 --> 00:14:13.490
In exchange for what we
find out in this investigation,

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:16.300
I might lose my current title...

00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:17.860
What do you mean?

00:14:18.230 --> 00:14:23.470
I have been receiving support from that
exact medication for a long time, myself.

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:24.710
What!?

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:30.210
As for the age limit regarding a Persona's
use, our thoughts are accurate.

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:33.510
I, too, was only able to use my Persona
without depending on the medicine for...

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:34.810
Then...

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:45.050
Anyway, back to the topic...

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:48.790
What's the matter, Kanzato?

00:15:09.850 --> 00:15:11.280
Komatsubara...

00:15:12.190 --> 00:15:15.090
I go by Kujo Mareya now.

00:15:15.420 --> 00:15:19.390
Komatsubara Keisuke died five years ago.

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:22.690
You've become admirable, Kanzato-kun.

00:15:31.840 --> 00:15:33.910
See you guys later.

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:36.140
What did you need from aniki?

00:15:36.140 --> 00:15:37.350
Just something.

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:40.510
Right. I forgot you're not
allowed to talk about your work.

00:15:40.510 --> 00:15:42.320
Nope. He's not answering.

00:15:42.320 --> 00:15:44.550
All right... There's nothing we could do.

00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:49.160
About that apron...

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:52.690
Yeah, it was mine. I gave it to him a while ago.

00:15:52.690 --> 00:15:54.160
He's a Chief, you know?

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:58.000
I didn't want him staining
his uniform while he cooked.

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:01.170
I see...

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:04.030
Were you two dating?

00:16:06.710 --> 00:16:08.140
I wonder...

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:11.200
But you like him, right?

00:16:12.980 --> 00:16:15.110
Sure, I like him.

00:16:26.390 --> 00:16:30.930
The cancellation of that project
was unfortunate news for us both.

00:16:30.930 --> 00:16:37.060
Even Personas, with god-like
appearances and immeasurable powers,

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:40.830
couldn't fight providence.

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:46.310
Personas are merely creations of the human mind.

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:48.680
It cannot be helped.

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:53.720
However, I have the ability to overturn providence.

00:16:53.720 --> 00:16:58.720
And the creation of an ultimate
existence is about to become reality.

00:17:02.600 --> 00:17:09.970
This is meant to be. Not just you, but your two...

00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:16.440
No, three siblings have all finally
awakened to their special existence.

00:17:16.440 --> 00:17:18.710
This is absolutely delightful.

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:29.820
After ten years, all of my wishes
are miraculously bearing fruit.

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:33.760
Truly, it was bound to happen,
through the desires of the great mind.

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:38.130
First, I want you.

00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:43.760
Tomorrow after sunset, I'll wait for you in
the snowfield that looks over Cross Valley.

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:02.460
Hey, what just happened?

00:18:02.460 --> 00:18:04.010
What was that noise just now?

00:18:05.090 --> 00:18:07.190
Komatsubara is still alive.

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:19.370
Shin-niichan is so weird.

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:25.110
He was jealous of both
Ryo-oniichan and Eiko-oneechan...

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:57.680
He's the one who let Toma die.

00:18:57.680 --> 00:19:00.610
How could he come back like this?

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:02.650
Saki is the one who brought him back.

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:04.690
He lost his wallet and starved himself.

00:19:04.690 --> 00:19:06.690
Well, he did the best he could.

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:11.360
Anyway, why is he able to live even
after his Persona was extracted?

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:14.160
It wasn't extracted; just cut off.

00:19:14.160 --> 00:19:17.600
Same thing, right? Either way...

00:19:17.970 --> 00:19:19.590
I don't think they're the same.

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:25.270
He probably has a special body-type.

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:29.310
Even Saki almost died that time.

00:19:30.740 --> 00:19:33.250
I really appreciate what you did, Sotaro.

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:36.120
I can understand why he didn't want to come back.

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:38.320
He wouldn't know how to act around us, huh?

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:40.320
Too naïve, Udo.

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:44.390
Not only was he hiding the fact that his
Persona had been taken by Kanzato Shin,

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:47.390
he let Toma die. It's a heavy crime.

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:49.020
He's alive.

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:53.030
Toma is alive.

00:19:54.230 --> 00:20:00.660
Unfortunately, he's definitely being
kept frozen at the inspection lab.

00:20:00.980 --> 00:20:03.380
I went to see him for you.

00:20:04.280 --> 00:20:07.050
He got killed by Kanzato Ryo.

00:20:07.050 --> 00:20:11.680
I'm sure he's being cremated as
an unidentified victim by now.

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:17.850
I saw him.

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:26.300
Keep looking for him, if that makes you happy.

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:35.540
Shikura Toma is all of your beloved
brother and my significant comrade.

00:20:39.650 --> 00:20:42.350
I'll call him back when the time comes.

00:20:42.350 --> 00:20:48.760
You remain at Naginomori Academy
and stay near the Kanzato brothers.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:49.850
Yes, sir.

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:52.920
About Yuji...

00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:55.690
I have other tasks for him.

00:20:59.500 --> 00:21:02.300
The list has been brought up once again.

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:07.740
This area has been considered
the most Latent-populated...

00:21:07.810 --> 00:21:11.180
However, there aren't many left.

00:21:11.180 --> 00:21:18.650
Now is the time to collect all
Personas before they face extinction.

00:21:18.650 --> 00:21:23.560
We will rule the Sea of Psyche...

00:21:23.890 --> 00:21:25.550
and...

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:33.990
become the saviors of humanity's consciousness.

00:21:43.710 --> 00:21:50.120
omotai kusariwo
The heavy chain

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:55.860
ima hazushite agemashou
I will take it off for you

00:21:55.860 --> 00:22:01.300
jiyuuni naretara
Once you're free

00:22:01.300 --> 00:22:08.200
kokowo habataite yukeruwa
You'll be able to fly away

00:22:08.200 --> 00:22:14.810
atashiga samatage
I stood in your way

00:22:14.810 --> 00:22:23.380
ubatte kita madaminu sekai e
and took that world you haven't seen

00:22:23.450 --> 00:22:27.720
tamerau nonara
If you're going to hesitate

00:22:27.720 --> 00:22:36.560
huriharatte ageru sono udewo
I will free that arm for you

00:22:36.560 --> 00:22:41.030
soshite tookue
Then to faraway

00:22:41.030 --> 00:22:47.210
dekirudake tookue
As far away as possible

00:22:47.210 --> 00:22:50.510
aishiteruno
"I love you"

00:22:50.510 --> 00:22:54.210
ikanaideyo
"Don't leave me"

00:22:54.210 --> 00:23:01.140
koware chaukara
I will break

00:23:10.860 --> 00:23:13.930
For some, the only choice was to cling on.

00:23:13.930 --> 00:23:17.000
For some, the only choice was to vanish.

00:23:17.000 --> 00:23:19.870
To reproach and torment them are the sins

00:23:19.870 --> 00:23:22.770
of those who invaded the spirits.

00:23:22.980 --> 00:23:28.620
Two small lives and futures.
A temporary nightmare.

00:23:28.620 --> 00:23:33.750
Those that love instead of those that were loved.

00:23:33.750 --> 00:23:36.090
A tragic determination.

00:23:36.090 --> 00:23:38.760
That is his Persona.
